  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Jade Pool blessed land, after a miniman ally answers Dong Fang Chang Fan’s call, jade green light delivers Miniscule Mountain into his hands. While he holds the mountain and drives Myriad Star Fireflies, an ice dragon shrinks to an ice snake, a strength path giant hand shrinks to less than one percent of its size, and a heavenly flower fades and wilts, so he blocks the remnants with a sleeve wave. Pi Shui Han names the method immortal killer move Big to Small. The miniman Gu Immortal with the surname Fang inside Miniscule Mountain had allied with Dong Fang tribe for living space and uses the method to suppress the demons’ surge.",
      "chapters": [
        801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
