      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unfettered Scholar holds Immortal Gu Disintegrate with immortal killer move Thousand Disintegrations, so the demonic path side leans on him to answer in kind. He lands thousand disintegrations on Miniscule Mountain, but big to small counters it; the miniman Gu Immortal mocks that Unfettered Scholar’s Disintegrate is only rank six while Small is rank seven. With Miniscule Mountain, Old Lord Can Yang, and rising Myriad Star Fireflies, Dong Fang Chang Fan’s side looks impregnable, and the demons find no counter to big to small besides trying to drain immortal essence by numbers.",
      "chapters": [
        801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
