        "char_old_lord_can_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s six strength path giant hands press him, Dong Fang Chang Fan raises Miniscule Mountain and uses the big to small immortal killer move to weaken those hands before breaking them apart.",
